text = "[font_size=20]There once were a gang of crafty Pom-Poms. They are very cute, and (they'd like to think) almost as smart. Smart enough to escape from their craft-box prison.

You must gather them up as best you can, before too many wander into danger! Use your mouse or finger to draw circles around a Pom-Pom. Once immobilised, the PomPom can be dragged back into the box where they came from.[/font_size]"
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false

