text = "[font_size=20][i]Rescuing Pom-Poms[/i]
• Circle a Pom-Pom 3 times, then click 'em to begin pulling. Place them in the Box
• Try to use momentum to fling a Pom-Pom toward the Box

[i]Avoiding Damage[/i]
• The blades on Scissors will cut your Rope & damage Pom-Poms!
• Cats will also cut Rope & damage Pom-Poms!

[i]Cat Behaviour[/i]
• Cats won't pursue a Pom-Pom unless they see you moving one with Rope
• If you drop their newfound plaything, the Cat will lose interest[/font_size]"
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false

